    {
      "name": "Drag",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The experienced hound is adjacent to a Prone creature</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The experienced hound attempts an Athletics check to Grapple the prone creature. The experienced hound can then Step away from the target; if the target is Grabbed by the hound, it is moved into the hound's previous square and remains grabbed.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>An experienced hound has been on dozens of hunts. They are often raised from pups to catch the scents of certain animals and deliver their bodies unharmed when taken down by their owners. An experienced hound could accompany a hunter or other NPC who specializes in tracking down prey.</p>",
